  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &amp; <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
